(6070838, 893009, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the background matched the subject matter better.  Why would you put an expensive piece of electronics on the floor?  A white background would have been cleaner and would have made more sense than a floor.</td>', 'I wish the background matched the subject matter better.  Why would you put an expensive piece of electronics on the floor?  A white background would have been cleaner and would have made more sense than a floor.', '2010-06-27 02:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6070849, 892914, 47470, '<td valign="top">The background of this image should be white, but it''s not.  It''s middle gray.  That makes the image look dingy, which it not what you probably want to convey with wine and hearts.  Some sharpening could also go a long way with this image.</td>', 'The background of this image should be white, but it''s not.  It''s middle gray.  That makes the image look dingy, which it not what you probably want to convey with wine and hearts.  Some sharpening could also go a long way with this image.', '2010-06-27 02:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6070860, 892863, 40965, '<td valign="top">At first I was having issues with this picture. The following went through my mind looking at this photo for the first time: "There''s nothing book-like about this picture," Where is the well known rectangular-shape, and where are the pages?" I just "turned the page" first, looking through the photos, and then later on I returned to <i>The Book of Secrets</i>, and I looked at it, again, but this time differently when its uniqueness finally reached my brain.<br/>Nice work!</td>', 'At first I was having issues with this picture. The following went through my mind looking at this photo for the first time: "There''s nothing book-like about this picture," Where is the well known rectangular-shape, and where are the pages?" I just "turned the page" first, looking through the photos, and then later on I returned to The Book of Secrets, and I looked at it, again, but this time differently when its uniqueness finally reached my brain.Nice work!', '2010-06-27 03:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6070861, 893049, 40965, '<td valign="top">My favourite season is autumn, and I really like the way you built this picture up: parallel dry leaves with old book. The only thing I would have done differently is cropping: cut out of focus leaves on top, and leave the crisp ones (in focus). But it''s only my personal view and preference. In other respect: I like it!</td>', 'My favourite season is autumn, and I really like the way you built this picture up: parallel dry leaves with old book. The only thing I would have done differently is cropping: cut out of focus leaves on top, and leave the crisp ones (in focus). But it''s only my personal view and preference. In other respect: I like it!', '2010-06-27 03:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6070863, 893114, 47470, '<td valign="top">I fail to see how toy help this image in any way.</td>', 'I fail to see how toy help this image in any way.', '2010-06-27 03:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6070864, 893112, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the dramatic lighting.  It perfectly matches the mood of image.  I''m not sure the title helps though.</td>', 'I love the dramatic lighting.  It perfectly matches the mood of image.  I''m not sure the title helps though.', '2010-06-27 03:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6070867, 891999, 40965, '<td valign="top">Interesting! Good composition.</td>', 'Interesting! Good composition.', '2010-06-27 03:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6070868, 893083, 40965, '<td valign="top">I like the way the book and the lit chandeliers form a "&lt;" shape, drawing my eyes towards that nice lamp base. Nice composition.</td>', 'I like the way the book and the lit chandeliers form a "<" shape, drawing my eyes towards that nice lamp base. Nice composition.', '2010-06-27 03:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6070869, 892011, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the light had come from the other side so the back of the book wouldn''t be so bright.  Such a large bright spot is pretty distracting.</td>', 'I wish the light had come from the other side so the back of the book wouldn''t be so bright.  Such a large bright spot is pretty distracting.', '2010-06-27 03:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6070870, 892331, 47470, '<td valign="top">This is a very clean set-up, but I find the reflection distracting because it is pretty detailed and one of the brightest spots in the image.</td>', 'This is a very clean set-up, but I find the reflection distracting because it is pretty detailed and one of the brightest spots in the image.', '2010-06-27 03:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6070871, 893029, 47470, '<td valign="top">There are no whites in this image.  The brightest parts of this image are actually light grey.  You can compare the brightest parts of this image to the background of DPC to see just how dark this image it.  With so much detail, it would also be nice if it were sharper.</td>', 'There are no whites in this image.  The brightest parts of this image are actually light grey.  You can compare the brightest parts of this image to the background of DPC to see just how dark this image it.  With so much detail, it would also be nice if it were sharper.', '2010-06-27 03:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6070931, 892742, 118981, '<td valign="top">nice creative effect!</td>', 'nice creative effect!', '2010-06-27 10:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6070943, 892242, 76185, '<td valign="top">Love the idea here. Kinda wish it were a little crisper but has a nice dreamy look to it.</td>', 'Love the idea here. Kinda wish it were a little crisper but has a nice dreamy look to it.', '2010-06-27 10:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
