(6073629, 892011, 118396, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments - I am a photgraphy rookie.  I set this picture up on the back of our couch in our family room with reading lamps stuck between the cushions on either side of her (I was trying not to touch the hot bulbs on anything &amp; burn the house down!).  I will adjust my jerry-rigging better next time.  I welcome any more advice!!</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments - I am a photgraphy rookie.  I set this picture up on the back of our couch in our family room with reading lamps stuck between the cushions on either side of her (I was trying not to touch the hot bulbs on anything & burn the house down!).  I will adjust my jerry-rigging better next time.  I welcome any more advice!!', '2010-06-30 01:05:29.000000', NULL, 0),
