(6073690, 893040, 67697, '<td valign="top">Well I guess I''ll leave a comment that explains the score I gave you.  I gave this a 5.  I thought you did fine with the lighting and not overexposing anything.  But since the subject was books, and you have them so prominent in the foreground, I felt that they should have been in focus.  For some reason the part of the table to the left looks sharp and part of the books on the left edge too.  The only thing I can think is that maybe your camera was just a smidge too close to the books?</td>', 'Well I guess I''ll leave a comment that explains the score I gave you.  I gave this a 5.  I thought you did fine with the lighting and not overexposing anything.  But since the subject was books, and you have them so prominent in the foreground, I felt that they should have been in focus.  For some reason the part of the table to the left looks sharp and part of the books on the left edge too.  The only thing I can think is that maybe your camera was just a smidge too close to the books?', '2010-06-30 01:20:26.000000', NULL, 0),
