(6074257, 892907, 99263, '<td valign="top">Congratz on the blue with this most deserving entry. Very cool and really very well done.<br/> <br/>It reminds me a little also of the "Secret Chamber" on the South African music group "Die Antwoord"s website: TIP! Move your cursor over the various animated faces in the image with your sound turned on:<br/><a href="//www.dieantwoord.com/secret.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dieantwoord.com/secret.html</a> <br/>and this lovely group photo of them:<br/><a href="//files.myopera.com/coxy/albums/527288/die_antwoord1.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//files.myopera.com/coxy/albums/527288/die_antwoord1.jpg</a> <br/>And the artwork incorporated into their zany video-clip..do give it a listen, it''s something else:<br/><a href="//www.youtube.com/watch?v=wc3f4xU_FfQ" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.youtube.com/watch?v=wc3f4xU_FfQ</a> <br/> <br/>And I myself have 2 images in my DPC portfolio as well that incorporate Zebra Stripes:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=845834" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=845834</a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=805523" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=805523</a> <br/> <br/>As someone already mentioned, it also does remind a little of Keith Haring''s famous and controversial self portrait photographed by the famous Annie Leibowitz:<br/><a href="//peet.wordpress.com/2006/10/26/keith-haring-paints-himself/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//peet.wordpress.com/2006/10/26/keith-haring-paints-himself/</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-06-30 09:41:33.</i></td>', 'Congratz on the blue with this most deserving entry. Very cool and really very well done. It reminds me a little also of the "Secret Chamber" on the South African music group "Die Antwoord"s website: TIP! Move your cursor over the various animated faces in the image with your sound turned on://www.dieantwoord.com/secret.html and this lovely group photo of them://files.myopera.com/coxy/albums/527288/die_antwoord1.jpg And the artwork incorporated into their zany video-clip..do give it a listen, it''s something else://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wc3f4xU_FfQ  And I myself have 2 images in my DPC portfolio as well that incorporate Zebra Stripes://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=845834 //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=805523  As someone already mentioned, it also does remind a little of Keith Haring''s famous and controversial self portrait photographed by the famous Annie Leibowitz://peet.wordpress.com/2006/10/26/keith-haring-paints-himself/', '2010-06-30 10:29:29.000000', '2010-06-30 10:41:33.000000', 0),
