(6074304, 892917, 17507, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment after reading <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1014669" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this post</a>. I didn''t see the face either--I saw a curious arrangement of books, but it didn''t resolve into any structure for me. I gave you a 6 for what appeared to be deliberate weirdness; you''d have gotten more points from me for better sharpness in the areas of interest and for more careful lighting with less of a yellow cast.</td>', 'Coming back to comment after reading this post. I didn''t see the face either--I saw a curious arrangement of books, but it didn''t resolve into any structure for me. I gave you a 6 for what appeared to be deliberate weirdness; you''d have gotten more points from me for better sharpness in the areas of interest and for more careful lighting with less of a yellow cast.', '2010-06-30 10:53:26.000000', NULL, 0),
